 sustained TE Eliot Lee's complaint against KEP for filing a civil lawsuit in New Jersey state court to adjudicate ecclesiastical matters (i.e., who was the rightful pastor of HKPC). The opinion affirms that PCA church courts have no authority to use civil courts to enforce ecclesiastical decisions, and that the PCA is a non-hierarchical denomination whose authority is moral and spiritual, not civil or coercive."}},{"id":"bco:22-6--case:cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md","record_id":"case:cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md","type":"Judicial case","title":"Eliot Lee v. Korean Eastern Presbytery","year":2008,"disposition":"denied","authority_weight":"high","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md","evidence_basis":"direct_text","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:22-6--case:cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md:occ-ad8b224cfd3b","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.html","repository_path":"cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md","locator":{"fragment":null,"line":49},"excerpt":"…year or until all matters are resolved\") and how this action conflicts with BCO 22-6, i.e. temporary pastoral relationships (stated supply) are limited to a period of time no longer than one year and must be renewed annually by the Presbytery; the…","sources":["case_markdown_text","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_as","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_current","judicial_cases.jsonl:bco_provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md"},{"id":"bco:22-6--case:cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md:occ-192fb6f2476a","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.html","repository_path":"cases/ga36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.